<title>USA: Pentair buys Italian equipment maker.</title>
<headline>Pentair buys Italian equipment maker.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pentair Inc said Monday it strengthened its presence in the European water treatment industry by acquiring privately held SIATA SpA, a Florence, Italy-based manufacturer of water conditioning control equipment for commercial and residential applications.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction, which closed Monday, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>	    ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
